course: dictionary
lesson: 9544
title: Stony: stones or cold looks?
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word «stony» has three meanings. The sentences around it tell you which one you need. «Walk carefully along the stony beach» means covered with stones, because you are walking on a beach full of stones.
explain: «The seeds fell on stony soil and did not grow.» Here stony means hard, rocky ground. In stories, a «stony stare» or «stony silence» tells you a person is cold, angry or unfriendly, and shows no kind feeling. Ask: is this about the ground, or about a person's face and mood?
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. If «covered with stones» makes sense in «a stony beach», you have the right meaning. If it sounds silly in «a stony silence», try the cold, unfriendly meaning instead.
fact: Stony means full of stones or covered with stones, as in «a stony beach».
fact: Stony also means hard like stone.
fact: A stony face, look or silence is cold and shows no kind feeling.
fact: «Most deserts are rocky or stony rather than covered in sand dunes.»
fact: «Some asteroids are dark and rich in carbon, some are stony, and a few are mostly metal, like the asteroid Psyche.»
exercise: «Most deserts are rocky or stony rather than covered in sand dunes.» What does stony mean here? | *Covered with stones | Very wet and muddy | Warm and friendly | Full of soft sand
exercise: «She gave him a stony stare and said nothing.» What does stony suggest? | Lost and confused | Full of stones like a beach | *Cold and unfriendly, with no kind feeling | Warm and happy
exercise: Which phrase means an idea that nobody accepts? | stony-faced | *fall on stony ground | a stony beach | stony soil
test: «The stony silence in the room made everyone feel uneasy.» What does stony mean in this sentence? | Warm and friendly | *Cold and showing no kind feeling | Full of stones | Very loud and noisy
test: «Some asteroids are stony.» What does stony describe here? | Asteroids that are hot and angry | Asteroids that glow in the dark | Asteroids that are soft like sand | *Asteroids made mostly of rock
exam: Mia says stony means soft and sandy, like a beach in a desert. Why is she wrong? | Stony means very hot | *Stony means full of stones or hard like stone, not soft | Stony means happy and bright | Stony means soft and sandy, so she is right
